        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fb959e83-0742-3df2-991e-64c7c8b4f0f8",
                "word": "pochopny",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "972fcfdf-58dc-3516-8391-2c906fa48921",
                        "entry_id": "fb959e83-0742-3df2-991e-64c7c8b4f0f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zbyt szybki, nieprzemyślany"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0959c99-3f35-422d-9aa7-2fa0ccfd9e8b",
                                "sense_id": "972fcfdf-58dc-3516-8391-2c906fa48921",
                                "text": "Twój pochopny osąd wpłynął na podjęcie błędnej decyzji."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e3aa691-37f1-40c7-b5dc-78f373bd8b00",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb959e83-0742-3df2-991e-64c7c8b4f0f8",
                        "source_sense_id": "972fcfdf-58dc-3516-8391-2c906fa48921",
                        "target_lang_word": "hasty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hasty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or done in haste; hurried or too quick; speedy due to having little time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b94f6b0-af38-48e8-9220-3055425dca63",
                                                "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                                "text": "Without much thinking about it they made a hasty decision to buy it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a702880a-385d-4972-b20b-fc1ffe223061",
                                                "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                                "text": "If there bee any lasie fellow, any that cannot away with worke, any that would wallow in pleasures, hee is hastie to be priested. And when hee is made one, and has gotten a benefice, he consorts with his neighbour priests, who are altogether given to pleasures; and then both hee, and they, live, not like Christians, but like epicures; drinking, eating, feasting, and revelling, till the cow come home, as the saying is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41c3ce19-8250-4606-9135-ac3a1b6e4de6",
                                                "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                                "text": "I have written these hasty lines in no small hurry, and send them to you, not from an opinion, that they contain any thing worth imparting, but merely in compliance with your and Mr Simon's request[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e656871e-110e-4e09-b33b-f7a564d39863",
                                                "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                                "text": "Watch yourself, be the first to ask pardon if you both err, and guard against the little piques, misunderstandings, and hasty words that often pave the way for bitter sorrow and regret."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b3df18d-beb4-4f0d-ba0f-353f150e77ec",
                                                "sense_id": "e74720f0-a942-3c62-8f39-0648e9a36751",
                                                "text": "But about three o'clock George's ear caught the hasty and decided click of a horse's hoof coming behind them at some distance and jogged Phineas by the elbow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36488bbf-2271-35e5-86bf-05cd10ff5de6",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or done in haste; hurried or too quick; speedy due to having little time.",
                                            "Made in haste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9c1d56d-6bf8-4565-8af0-f4481054f983",
                                                "sense_id": "36488bbf-2271-35e5-86bf-05cd10ff5de6",
                                                "text": "Sommer Hony, or hasty hony, made in thirty dales after the tenth of June."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7138ea2-173b-4b58-a85a-c5de030f6a6b",
                                                "sense_id": "36488bbf-2271-35e5-86bf-05cd10ff5de6",
                                                "text": "[We] built a hasty fort of sawlogs and boulders back of our campsite, well stocked with powder and ball, water and meat, in case there was trouble."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "308e052d-f882-327b-8ed7-f661c60571b9",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or done in haste; hurried or too quick; speedy due to having little time.",
                                            "Ripening or coming to maturity early."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03347a1a-9458-4240-a018-f33352ad7f7d",
                                                "sense_id": "308e052d-f882-327b-8ed7-f661c60571b9",
                                                "text": "... how to make the trees themselves more tall, more spread, and more hasty and sudden than they use to be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6e481a5-3ddd-40ff-a7e8-67d1a9e71c36",
                                                "sense_id": "308e052d-f882-327b-8ed7-f661c60571b9",
                                                "text": "I speke not of hasty pees, for they be sowen before Christmasse"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d8826eb-3bcb-3e1f-948f-15e28df7663b",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or done in haste; hurried or too quick; speedy due to having little time.",
                                            "Eager or impatient to act or get something done."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec7a6ed-6d91-40e6-a9a9-85727e603348",
                                                "sense_id": "7d8826eb-3bcb-3e1f-948f-15e28df7663b",
                                                "text": "... how is it that ye be so hasty to […] departe hens?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "666c6e7e-483e-47a8-81f7-8d6ea72ebae6",
                                                "sense_id": "7d8826eb-3bcb-3e1f-948f-15e28df7663b",
                                                "text": "... the Queene is not so hasty of your death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68f61119-7f60-342f-9355-4ec85705176c",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acting or done in haste; hurried or too quick; speedy due to having little time.",
                                            "Characterized by undue quickness of action, and thus lacking careful thought or consideration; rash, precipitate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4247f4c-0711-4c52-aae7-0195e8f2614a",
                                                "sense_id": "68f61119-7f60-342f-9355-4ec85705176c",
                                                "text": "a hasty decision, a hasty assertion"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ba81327-72c8-46c5-9212-59aa92cfe50b",
                                                "sense_id": "68f61119-7f60-342f-9355-4ec85705176c",
                                                "text": "... to give too hasty belief to pretended miracles,[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5b055c5-b2c5-3d45-a21d-1a00cafe5c9d",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Speedy, quick, rapid (without necessarily lacking time)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5a77525-35d0-4ed2-be7c-2c6c37edb280",
                                                "sense_id": "d5b055c5-b2c5-3d45-a21d-1a00cafe5c9d",
                                                "text": "This people hathe a swyfte hasty speche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16c5bbce-5f46-4751-b907-07f5b19965f5",
                                                "sense_id": "d5b055c5-b2c5-3d45-a21d-1a00cafe5c9d",
                                                "text": "Thys wolfbayne of all poysones is the most hastye poison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "829b009b-4adb-3b65-a062-43bf739f7de7",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irritable, irascible; quickly or easily excited to anger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "413d6bf0-76cd-4662-b175-0d3c43b803ef",
                                                "sense_id": "829b009b-4adb-3b65-a062-43bf739f7de7",
                                                "text": "his hasty temperament"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1481f8e-b8d4-4969-974a-21b32175daa4",
                                                "sense_id": "829b009b-4adb-3b65-a062-43bf739f7de7",
                                                "text": "The natural disposition of Theodosius was hasty and choleric;[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08de0045-96a6-4467-90e3-797200f7000c",
                                                "sense_id": "829b009b-4adb-3b65-a062-43bf739f7de7",
                                                "text": "... I spake eny hasty worde […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d73d57b-b7b6-4f43-a13f-8ade5aaf7d62",
                                                "sense_id": "829b009b-4adb-3b65-a062-43bf739f7de7",
                                                "text": "To say that such a one has rather a hasty temper, or that he is difficult to get on with, or that he is too fond of having his own way, is hardly, in the opinion of many people, to say anything really to his discredit;[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cd65ce8-708b-3de9-a13c-5fd97921cb82",
                                        "entry_id": "35bf271e-40cf-3746-8a48-184fc1cee573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heavy, violent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of rain"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4144748-0e0a-4a62-9000-4c6b51acccc8",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd65ce8-708b-3de9-a13c-5fd97921cb82",
                                                "text": "Hasty rain liberates flukes' eggs from sheep's droppings, and splashes them round about upon the circumjacent herbage; but healthy sheep, protected by their nose, are in little danger here of swallowing these eggs […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f12ea4e0-bbce-43c1-86be-a5a79a66973b",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd65ce8-708b-3de9-a13c-5fd97921cb82",
                                                "text": "... hasty rain. When we came home we found Cousin Gwinn Harris and wife at our home. In the evening there was still another rain. These rains are all alike (hard and hasty).[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e6cd9eb-41b9-4a23-9e29-8aebd5566f50",
                                                "sense_id": "9cd65ce8-708b-3de9-a13c-5fd97921cb82",
                                                "text": "'[…] rain divert me, although it is coming down hasty.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "52f1262e-8307-4cec-9a48-602fffd743e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb959e83-0742-3df2-991e-64c7c8b4f0f8",
                        "source_sense_id": "972fcfdf-58dc-3516-8391-2c906fa48921",
                        "target_lang_word": "voreilig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "voreilig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "596ee6b8-0e2d-3fa5-afc2-c6c6f73347fa",
                                        "entry_id": "a1d4570e-2353-38e6-ae9c-880263e20a4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zu schnell (eilig), ohne sich Zeit zum Nachdenken zu geben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fbe7028-c380-4aee-b8b1-4829330bba43",
                                                "sense_id": "596ee6b8-0e2d-3fa5-afc2-c6c6f73347fa",
                                                "text": "Uschi ist beim Kauf der ersten Lebkuchen noch voreiliger als Renate gewesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49f096d3-2378-413e-9fe8-cf0a9306deb5",
                                                "sense_id": "596ee6b8-0e2d-3fa5-afc2-c6c6f73347fa",
                                                "text": "Ich bitte Sie inständig, keine voreiligen Schlüsse zu ziehen!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "809fff46-edd2-4372-af68-de4dd588565c",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb959e83-0742-3df2-991e-64c7c8b4f0f8",
                        "source_sense_id": "972fcfdf-58dc-3516-8391-2c906fa48921",
                        "target_lang_word": "vorschnell",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vorschnell",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "195137ff-f5ec-30fa-b53c-e97428249254",
                                        "entry_id": "58bca82e-4f32-362c-a56f-825433defc3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zu schnell, zu früh, da unbedacht und unüberlegt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c2c2866-341a-4ff2-afc9-cffc43932b9c",
                                                "sense_id": "195137ff-f5ec-30fa-b53c-e97428249254",
                                                "text": "„Und so ist die Unterhaltung in den Orchesterpausen oft recht aufschlußreich; hier kreuzen und befruchten einander die Meinungen des reiferen Alters, das die Herrlichkeiten der Klassiker auszuschöpfen und voll nachzuerleben weiß, mit dem oft vorschnellen Urteil der talentierten, in Sturm und Drang endlich mal Neues witternden Jugend, der Standpunkt des Erfahrenen, der mit dem weiteren Horizont die Modernen aus höherer Perspektive betrachtet, mit dem des klassisch geschulten und gegen ungewohnte Härten empfindlichen Jungen, der glaubt, ablehnen zu müssen, wo der abgeklärte Kollege zumindest duldsam lächelt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85391d57-f590-4fc2-915c-2b26bb7cc04b",
                                                "sense_id": "195137ff-f5ec-30fa-b53c-e97428249254",
                                                "text": "„Auch wird niemand, der sachlich urteilt, behaupten wollen, die Zeiten der Demokratie seien aus irgendwelchen mythischen Gründen vorüber. Die Kraft, die heute in der Welt gerade, von den demokratischen Staaten ausstrahle zeigt, daß ein solcher Schluß vorschnell und ungerechtfertigt ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c9773ec-5903-4ac3-bba8-cc5b0776f291",
                                                "sense_id": "195137ff-f5ec-30fa-b53c-e97428249254",
                                                "text": "„Egal, wie einmalig die Gelegenheit erscheinen mag: Kapitalanleger sollten sich auf keinen Fall unter Druck setzen lassen und vorschnell Kaufentscheidungen treffen, bei denen es um viel Geld geht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b2b4edc-bc22-4f24-a5d1-68cc385c67c2",
                                                "sense_id": "195137ff-f5ec-30fa-b53c-e97428249254",
                                                "text": "„Die Bahn hat vorschnell die Sanierung als großen Erfolg dargestellt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
